meta {
  name: 1 Get my showcase
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/showcase/me
  body: none
}

docs {
  The signed-in provider's own showcase: tagline, about, photo/logo hashes, the portfolio in display order,
  a completeness checklist and the scan→visit→booking funnel. Created empty on first read. Provider role only (403
  otherwise). `takenDown: true` means an operator hid it; only the owner still sees it.
}
